{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/92bdd3d58e02d27b66bbb72ba39d394c.avif?t=1764420487\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Overview</h2>Alternative Alliance Alpha (AL2\u03b1) is a short, whimsically gentle sci-fi post-apocalyptic adventure set in the distant future. Lighthearted on the surface, yet never without its shadows. Jinovika, a young man, finds himself drawn into a new daily life\u2014exploring the world beyond the colony alongside Armalion, his living partner in the form of a reinforced suit.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/61a572438e55738774a88d0f3a07dadf.avif?t=1764420487\" width=400 height=98 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Low commitment, low-calorie playtime (approx. 30 minutes each for Part 1 and Part 2, about 1 hour total*)<br></li><li>A wide variety of storylines you won\u2019t see all in a single playthrough<br></li><li>Multiple endings<br></li><li>Low difficulty\u2014no game-overs or dead ends</li></ul><br>*Both Part 1 and Part 2 are included in this single title.<br>A demo version of Part 1 is available.<br>There is no save data or story carryover between Part 1 and Part 2.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Other Features (for better or worse)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Human faces are generally not depicted.<br></li><li>The overall tone is relatively calm and subdued.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game System</h2>The system is slightly different between Part 1 and Part 2.<br><br><strong>Explore outside the colony</strong><br>Gather resources by venturing out. You may also encounter new characters or make unexpected discoveries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/b0e4c45fe51a4478f2c5cde489ddfe1d.avif?t=1764420487\" width=400 height=98 /></span><br><br><strong>Deliver resources</strong><br>Turning in resources increases your evaluation level, unlocking new story content and exploration areas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/4d4497bc6ea46f1261da09c8cb853054.avif?t=1764420487\" width=400 height=98 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2>One day, a massive hole tore open in the sky. The sandstorms that poured from it disrupted global communication, leaving each colony isolated. Before long, strange and unknown creatures began to roam the lands outside the colonies. People called them [Hybrid Beasts.] In a world transformed, each colony began to seek its own path to survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/c96d485e24570256354d7f92c17a3aaf.avif?t=1764420487\" width=400 height=98 /></span><br><br>Time passed since the onset of chaos. Humanity found new ways to live. One of them was the living enhanced suit [Armalion]\u2014gear capable of withstanding both the storms and the hybrid beasts. Though only a few could wear them, these suits became a symbol of hope for those sheltering within the colonies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/extras/182f8fbff399237fd8670448f541bd7c.avif?t=1764420487\" width=400 height=98 /></span><br><br>This is the story of one such enhanced suit\u2014and the young man who would come to wear it.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Work's Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/e6d0c8f92e783dee91667b2a82e282810157e650.jpg"},{"name":"Messenger Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/fa7e6045df4a20fd9b4b53668f6f6ef5ddeba86c.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter, Maybe?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/908549ed213f87fee41d686f5f8ae497eed13f7b.jpg"},{"name":"Watching with Willi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/19028b6e24b6d26409abbb93d4838e4db95bf690.jpg"},{"name":"Having Fun with Hel-chan\u2665","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/29f641ead43a42a0136fd5953083edb88e5a847f.jpg"},{"name":"Kazine's Assistant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/8d75bc0045a630cd69e6af526d200288475a52d5.jpg"},{"name":"Gyothe's Interlocutor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/6daa4cfec8293619cf71ceb51a7c91d663a131da.jpg"},{"name":"Reki's Colleague","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/d00c9651fccf241f96b5fadac96aba043b7ce63c.jpg"},{"name":"Trusted by Gesse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/9096b97538bb51f4295aed412d63c0a21ae91759.jpg"},{"name":"Tid's Advisor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614500/c7963aced20a500e5fc0bfbeacbd9a264b3fd814.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614500?t=1764420487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/14ca0d4f64900ea7387bf25f25f576dac86555a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764420487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/a07e68ee82b13c7f8915f38efa739eb01cbb2288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764420487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614500/a07e68ee82b13c7f8915f38efa739eb01cbb2288/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764420487","categories":[{"description":"Singl